target/
# tools/test and tools/doctor write their reports under target/verify/.
# Unanchored, so a nested one counts too: a test's CWD is its own crate
# directory, so `Snapshots::write` lands in crates/<name>/target/ there.
# tools/build-web stages web builds here; it is what deploys, never committed.
/dist
**/*.rs.bk
__pycache__/
*.pyc
